  data: {
    LLM: "22 deals (1-7 cards, then 8 special deals, then 7-1). Bid exact tricks. Trump by turned card (except specials: No Trump, Misere, Blind, Twos Wild, etc). Follow suit. Dealer's bid restricted so total ≠ cards dealt. Score for making bid.",
    Player: "22 deals (1-7 cards, then 8 special deals, then 7-1). Bid exact tricks. Trump by turned card (except specials: No Trump, Misere, Blind, Twos Wild, etc). Follow suit. Dealer's bid restricted so total ≠ cards dealt. Score for making bid.",
    objective: 'Players try to predict the exact number of tricks they will win in each deal. Over 22 deals (hand sizes 1–7, then eight special seven-card deals, then 7 down to 1), each player scores one point per trick won plus a 10-point bonus for making their bid exactly. The player with the highest cumulative score after all 22 deals wins.',
    gameplay: "22 deals (1-7 cards, then 8 special deals, then 7-1). Bid exact tricks. Trump by turned card (except specials: No Trump, Misere, Blind, Twos Wild, etc). Follow suit. Dealer's bid restricted so total ≠ cards dealt. Score for making bid.",
    keyRules: [
      '22 deals with specific structure',
      'Deals 1-7 and 16-22 are normal Oh Hell! deals',
      'Deals 8-15 are special deals with unique rules',
      "Dealer's bid restricted so total cannot equal cards dealt",
      'Cumulative scoring over all 22 deals',
    ],
